<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>Home Update — panel de mise à jour</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <img src="/logo.png" alt="Home Update" class="nav-logo" />
      <span class="brand-text">Home Update</span>
    </div>
    <div class="actions">
      <% if (user) { %>
        <a class="btn" href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
        <a class="btn danger" href="/logout">Déconnexion</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a class="btn primary" href="/login">Connexion Discord</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="container">
    <header class="hero">
      <span class="eyebrow">Panel opérationnel</span>
      <h1>Une commande, tous tes bots à jour</h1>
      <p>Home Update distribue tes releases et surveille chaque instance en direct, sans FTP ni intervention manuelle.</p>

      <div class="stat-bar">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <b><%= downloads %></b>
          <span>Téléchargements</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <b><%= totalBots %></b>
          <span>Bots suivis</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <b>24/7</b>
          <span>Signal en direct</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="home-tiles">
      <!-- Carte 1 : comment mettre à jour -->
      <div class="tile">
        <div class="tile-top">
          <div class="tile-badges">
            <span class="badge">Guide</span>
            <span class="badge orange">3 étapes</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge green"><span class="dot"></span> Automatique</span>
        </div>

        <div class="tile-stat-row">
          <div class="icon-box">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9L12 3z"/><path d="M12 12l8-4.5M12 12v9M12 12L4 7.5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="tile-stat">
            <b>+update</b>
            <span>Commande Discord</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <h2>Mettre à jour un bot</h2>
        <p class="sub">Le processus complet, du bot à la nouvelle version.</p>
        <ul class="steps">
          <li><span class="check">✓</span> Le bot envoie <strong>+update</strong> sur Discord</li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span> Il contacte Home Update et télécharge la dernière release</li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span> Les fichiers sont remplacés et le bot redémarre seul</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="tile-footer">
          <a class="btn primary" href="<%= user ? '/dashboard' : '/login' %>">Voir les releases →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Carte 2 : état de la flotte -->
      <div class="tile">
        <div class="tile-top">
          <div class="tile-badges">
            <span class="badge">Flotte</span>
          </div>
          <span class="badge green"><span class="dot"></span> En direct</span>
        </div>

        <div class="tile-stat-row">
          <div class="icon-box">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="8" width="16" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 8V6a3 3 0 016 0v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="14" r="1"/><circle cx="15" cy="14" r="1"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div class="tile-stat">
            <b><%= totalBots %></b>
            <span>Bots enregistrés</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <h2>État de la flotte</h2>
        <p class="sub">Dernière version : <strong><%= version %></strong> — publiée le <%= date %>.</p>
        <div class="stat-grid">
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-kpi"><%= totalBots %></div>
            <div class="stat-label">Total</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-kpi"><%= upToDate %></div>
            <div class="stat-label">À jour</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="stat-kpi"><%= outdated %></div>
            <div class="stat-label">Obsolètes</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tile-footer">
          <a class="btn primary" href="<%= user ? '/owner/status' : '/login' %>">Voir le détail →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <h2 class="section-title">Pourquoi Home Update ?</h2>
    <section class="why-grid">
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="icon-box sm">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L4 14h6l-1 8 9-12h-6l1-8z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Mise à jour instantanée</h4>
          <p>Appliquée en quelques secondes après la commande +update.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="icon-box sm">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 10-4.5-1.5-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>100% sécurisé</h4>
          <p>Tokens chiffrés en AES-256-GCM, jamais stockés en clair.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="icon-box sm">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0115.4-6.4M21 12a9 9 0 01-15.4 6.4"/><path d="M18 3v4h-4M6 21v-4h4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Restauration en un clic</h4>
          <p>Chaque release supprimée reste récupérable depuis la corbeille.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="icon-box sm">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 15v-3a8 8 0 0116 0v3"/><path d="M4 15a2 2 0 002 2h1v-5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2zM20 15a2 2 0 00-2-2h-1v5h1a2 2 0 002-2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Support 24/7</h4>
          <p>Une équipe joignable directement sur Discord.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Home Update ·
    <a href="<%= support %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Support Discord</a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
